passphrase-meter patches for tsyrogit/zxcvbn-c (applied by scripts/build-zxcvbn.sh to a copy; the submodule stays pristine).
- load any dictgen dictionary (no compiled-in CRC/size), from file, memory buffer or file descriptor;
  files are mapped read-only and used in place (no copy)
- no dictionary loaded: skip dictionary matching instead of crashing (Wultra-compatible)

